<%- contentFor('body') %>

<main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-container">
        <header class="policy-header">
            <span class="policy-badge">Logistics & Fulfillment</span>
            <h1>Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>
            <p class="policy-updated">Last Updated: November 2026</p>
        </header>

        <article class="policy-body">
            <p>This Shipping & Delivery Policy outlines the courier timelines and dispatch procedures for all hardware purchases made on <code>roinax.onrender.com</code>.</p>

            <h2>1. Shipping Charges</h2>
            <div class="policy-callout">
                <strong>Standard Courier Delivery is 100% FREE</strong> on all hardware, biometric scanners, printers, and accessories across all serviceable Indian PIN codes.
            </div>

            <h2>2. Dispatch & Order Processing Timelines</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Orders verified via Razorpay before 2:00 PM IST on business days are packed and prepared for courier handover within <strong>24 to 48 business hours</strong>.</li>
                <li>Orders confirmed on Sundays or national holidays are dispatched on the next working business day.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Estimated Delivery Times</h2>
            <p>Delivery time depends on your geographic location and local courier connectivity:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Metro & Tier 1 Cities:</strong> 3 to 5 business days from the date of dispatch.</li>
                <li><strong>Tier 2, Tier 3 & District Centers:</strong> 4 to 7 business days.</li>
                <li><strong>Rural Kiosk & Remote Postal Zones:</strong> 6 to 9 business days via India Post Speed Post / Regional Express Courier.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Courier Tracking & Invoicing</h2>
            <p>As soon as your hardware parcel is picked up by our logistics partner (Delhivery / Blue Dart / Trackon / India Post), you will receive a tracking Air Waybill (AWB) number and live tracking link via your registered email address.</p>

            <h2>5. Delivery Address Responsibilities</h2>
            <p>Buyers are responsible for providing an accurate 6-digit PIN code, complete landmark, and an active 10-digit mobile phone number. The delivery agent may attempt contact up to three times before the parcel is returned to our origin warehouse.</p>

            <div class="contact-card">
                <strong>Dispatch Inquiries:</strong><br>
                Email: <code>roinaxglobal@gmail.com</code><br>
                Helpline: +91 7318692999 (Mon–Sat, 10 AM – 6 PM IST)
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</main>